OL,3,GNEWSAFull inquest into teenager's
OL,4,Amurder to be held
OL,5,
OL,6,FA full inquest will be held into the
OL,7,Fdeath of murdered Sheffield schoolboy
OL,8,FHarvey Willgoose after a coroner
OL,9,Freversed an earlier decision not to
OL,10,Fresume her investigation.
OL,12,FHarvey, 15, was stabbed to death by
OL,13,FMohammed Umar Khan, 15, in front of
OL,14,Fchildren and teachers at All Saints
OL,15,FCatholic High School in February 2025.
OL,16,FKhan was found guilty of murder after a
OL,17,Ftrial last year and detained for a
OL,18,Fminimum of 16 years.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
