OL,3,GNEWSAFull inquest into teenager's
OL,4,Amurder to be held
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest was opened and adjourned in
OL,7,FFebruary last year pending the
OL,8,Fconclusion of the criminal case, but
OL,9,Fafter Khan's conviction senior coroner
OL,10,FTanyka Rawden initially decided not to
OL,11,Fresume proceedings.
OL,13,FHarvey's mother, Caroline, said it was
OL,14,Fa "huge relief" an inquest would now be
OL,15,Fheld.
